  "solution": {
    "text": "Total number of isomeric linear dipeptides which can be synthesised from racemic mixture of alanine are four $(4),$ by $(R)$ type and\r\n(S) type.\r\n($\\because$ Has two chiral centres)\r\ni.e.\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/2019_che_a71.png\">\r\nThe possible isomers are\r\n$$\r\n(R R),(S R),(R S) \\text { and }(S S)\r\n$$\r\nHence, total (4) isomeric linear dipeptides for alanine can be synthesised and option\r\n(d) is the correct answer.",
